<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem 1996 after-tax profit 5.80 bln.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem 1996 after-tax profit 5.80 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	  6,194.4   vs   7,790.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	    7,209.1   vs   7,432.3</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	  5,803.6   vs   6,094.5</p>
<p>    Group net sales		  43,652.1   vs  41,430.8</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	     1,599.8   vs   1,451.8</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	  29,068.8   vs  25,440.3</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	 8,259.2   vs   7,202.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		1,729.5   vs   2,449.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    1,080.8 profit vs 185.4 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     1,349.7   vs     506.0</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	   268.9   vs     691.4</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	   66.1 loss vs  172.6 loss</p>
<p>Extraordinary revenue 84.7 vs 937.4</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure     150.8   vs   1,109.9</p>
<p>    Taxation			    1,413.9   vs   1,342.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Borsodchem Rt is a chemical company. The figures are consolidated, they were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
